  "steps": [
    "In a bowl, mix the Skyr, cocoa powder, and peanut butter until smooth.",
    "Line a sieve with a clean muslin cloth and transfer the mixture into it. Wrap it tightly and refrigerate for at least 3-4 hours or overnight.",
    "To make the blueberry compote, add the blueberries to a pan with a splash of water. Cook for 5-6 minutes until they become soft and jammy. Optionally add a little lemon zest for freshness. Let it cool.",
    "Unwrap the chilled Skyr and place it on a serving plate.",
    "Pour the melted 85% dark chocolate over the top.",
    "Sprinkle the high-protein muesli around the Skyr.",
    "Finish with the blueberry compote and serve immediately."
